    "Host API reads were measured in a separate active test session; TCP connect times are a network reference, not a measured WebSocket echo result.",
    "No platform fix or WebSocket implementation was deployed. Improvement estimates remain unverified.",
    "The stripped deployed binary was fingerprinted; its exact source revision was not established. Source reproductions ran on the recorded local checkout."
